{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"To factor means to rewrite an expression as a product. Let's try dividing the expression $140c+28-14a$ by each factor.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $7$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}140c+28-14a\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=7\\left(\\dfrac{140c+28-14a}{7}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=7\\left(\\dfrac{140c}{7}+\\dfrac{28}{7}-\\dfrac{14a}{7}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=7(20c+4-2a)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $140c+28-14a$ is equivalent to $7(20c+4-2a)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $2$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}140c+28-14a\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\left(\\dfrac{140c+28-14a}{2}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\left(\\dfrac{140c}{2}+\\dfrac{28}{2}-\\dfrac{14a}{2}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2(70c+14-7a)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $140c+28-14a$ is *not* equivalent to $2(70c+28-14a)$ or to $2(70a+14-7c)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $14$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}140c+28-14a\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=14\\left(\\dfrac{140c+28-14a}{14}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=14\\left(\\dfrac{140c}{14}+\\dfrac{28}{14}-\\dfrac{14a}{14}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=14(10c+2-a)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $140c+28-14a$ is equivalent to $14(10c+2-a)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following expressions are equivalent to $140c+28-14a$:\n\n- $7(20c+4-2a)$\n- $14(10c+2-a)$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Factor $140c+28-14a$ to identify the equivalent expressions.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $140c+28-14a$.","content":"$7(20c+4-2a)$","correct":true},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $140c+56-28a$.","content":"$2(70c+28-14a)$","correct":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $140c+28-14a$.","content":"$14(10c+2-a)$","correct":true,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $140a+28-14c$.","content":"$2(70a+14-7c)$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":true,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
